+**Axioms used (verbatim).** From
+[`MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md`](MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md): "There is one
+fixed nearest-neighbor admissibility rule, covariant under lattice translations
